# A whole game as the Rebel side, which only ends each turn; the computer plays the Union side, on the alternate map.
# Every victory condition but the time limit is turned off first.
# A digest at each of the 10 main menus, at Game Over and at the title menus.
# Written by tests/make_scripts.py.
#! seed 1869
#! cfg side=2 history=1 bold=4 randbal=3
#! altmap
#! files cws.his HISCORE.CWS
#! timeout 900

# Pauses that any key ends; End Turn and End Game: Yes; a Retreat: the first city; the
# Options at the game's end: Quit this Game.
rule 1 key space
rule 2:E text y
rule 2:R key enter
rule 2:O text q

# The title menu: Start NEW Game.
play until 2:V
digest
text s

# The main menu: UTILITY, End Cond. Victory Conditions starts on Time: down and Enter
# turn off each of the four others. Esc there, and Esc at the Utility menu.
play until 2:M
text u
prompt
text e
prompt
key down
prompt
key enter
prompt
key down
prompt
key enter
prompt
key down
prompt
key enter
prompt
key down
prompt
key enter
prompt
digest
key esc
prompt
key esc

# Each month's main menu: a digest, then END TURN.
repeat 10
play until 2:M
digest
text e
end

# The game ends. The Hall of Fame asks for the commander's name.
play until 4
text Tester
key enter
play until 1:G
digest
key space

# The title menu: Quit to DOS, and a key for END's "Press any key to continue".
play until 2:V
digest
text q
repeat space
